g: `marketsimulator-commodity-charts.service` repeatedly fails approximately every two seconds with **`200/CHDIR`**, because its working directory is missing. Its restart counter was **191984** at 08:25:51. This is unrelated to the OOM event.","started_at":1791700017,"completed_at":1791700179,"duration_ms":162318,"time_to_first_token_ms":15643}}
